# Djot visual demo {#top .title}

## Inline marks

Plain text with _emphasis_, *strong*, {=highlight=}, {+inserted+}, {-deleted-},
H~2~O and E=mc^2^, plus `verbatim *not* parsed` and {% a comment %} inline.
Escapes: \* not bold, non-breaking\ space, a hard break follows\
right here. Smart "quotes", it's, dashes -- en and --- em, and ellipsis...

Inline raw: `<b>bold html</b>`{=html}. Inline math: $`x^2 + y^2 = z^2`.
Display math: $$`\sum_{i=1}^n i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}`.

Symbol :smile: and a span [with class]{.note #span-id}.

## Links and images

Inline link [djot site](https://djot.net){title="Djot"}, reference link
[the spec][spec], collapsed [spec][], autolink <https://example.com>, and an
image ![placeholder](https://placehold.co/120x40 "A placeholder"){width=120}.

Footnote reference here[^note].

{.lead}
A paragraph with block attributes above it.

